      (END USER LICENSE AGREEMENT)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2810881937408
    m_Localized: To play the game, you must accept the Privacy Policy and End User
      License Agreement (EULA).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3131356123136
    m_Localized: PLAY GAME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3483161759744
    m_Localized: "Privacy Policy\r\nLast Updated: 29/07/2025\r\n\r\nMaveria (\"we,\"
      \"our,\" or \"us\") operates the Block Rush mobile application (\"the Game\").
      This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose personal data
      when you use our Game.\r\n\r\n1. INFORMATION COLLECTION AND USE\r\n\r\na) Automatically
      Collected Data:\r\nWe automatically collect your IP address to determine your
      approximate geographical location (such as country and city) using IP geolocation
      services. This data is used exclusively to provide regional leaderboards.\r\n\r\nb)
      User-Provided Data:\r\nIf you choose to set a player name, we store this name
      for display on the leaderboards.\r\n\r\nc) Third-Party Services and Data Usage:\r\n\r\n-
      Advertisements (Google AdMob):\r\n  We use Google AdMob to serve ads in the
      Game. AdMob may use cookies and collect device identifiers to provide personalized
      advertising.\r\n  More info: https://policies.google.com/privacy\r\n\r\n- Leaderboards
      (LootLocker):\r\n  We use LootLocker to manage online leaderboards. LootLocker
      collects player identifiers and scores.\r\n  More info: https://www.lootlocker.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nNote:
      We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these third-party
      services.\r\n\r\n2. DATA SECURITY\r\nWe take commercially reasonable measures
      to protect your data. However, please note that no method of transmission over
      the Internet or method of electronic storage is completely secure.\r\n\r\n3.
      CONTACT US\r\nIf you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
      us at:\r\ninfo@maveria.co\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3893658292224
    m_Localized: "End-User License Agreement (EULA)\r\nLast Updated: 29/07/2025\r\n\r\nThis
      End-User License Agreement (\"EULA\") is a legal agreement between you and
      Maveria (\"Company\") for the Block Rush software product (\"Software\").\r\n\r\nBy
      installing, copying, or otherwise using the Software, you agree to be bound
      by the terms of this EULA. If you do not agree to the terms of this EULA, do
      not install or use the Software.\r\n\r\n1. LICENSE GRANT\r\nThe Company grants
      you a revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable, limited license to download,
      install, and use the Software solely for your personal, non-commercial purposes,
      strictly in accordance with the terms of this Agreement.\r\n\r\n2. RESTRICTIONS
      ON USE\r\nYou agree not to, and you will not permit others to:\r\na) License,
      sell, rent, lease, assign, distribute, or otherwise commercially exploit the
      Software.\r\nb) Modify, reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any part
      of the Software.\r\nc) Remove or alter any trademark, logo, copyright, or other
      proprietary notices in the Software.\r\n\r\n3. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY\r\nAll
      trademarks, copyrights, and other intellectual property rights in and to the
      Software are the sole property of the Company.\r\n\r\n4. TERMINATION\r\nThis
      EULA is effective until terminated. Your rights under this license will automatically
      terminate without notice from the Company if you fail to comply with any term(s)
      of this EULA.\r\n\r\n5. GOVERNING LAW\r\nThis EULA shall be governed by and
      construed in accordance with the laws of the Republic of T\xFCrkiye, specifically
      the laws applicable in the province of Trabzon.\r\n\r\n"
