      Series\" by Omabuarts Studio (via Unity Asset Store)\n\"Cartoon FX Remaster
      Free\" by Jean Moreno (via Unity Asset Store)\r\n\r\n\r\n-MUSIC & SOUND-\r\nOriginal
      Music:\r\n\"8bit Music-062022\" by GWriterStudio\r\nSound Effects:\r\n\"RPG
      Essentials Sound Effects\" by leohpaz\r\n\"FREE UI Click Sound Pack\" from
